{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年38歲的歌手譚嘉儀（Kayee）今日（9日）正式升格人妻，恭喜！早前趁生日宣布獲圈外男友求婚成功的她，今日於印尼峇里島的豪華度假村舉行盛大婚禮。新娘子在社交平台興奮分享花絮片段，穿上精緻中式裙褂的她嬌小玲瓏，與身旁8位身穿湖水藍姊妹裙的港姐級姊妹團合照，場面非常震撼！</p><figure><img alt=\"譚嘉儀今日出嫁！ （ig@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185210807818915840456017.png/Qd4o5jW8e7M9uvMRt4U7Mlidf7EqwJulUPgbYlD4G2I\"/><figcaption>譚嘉儀今日出嫁！ （ig@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（ig@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185210749312700416463907.png/AMvGEb7c7YO4g6B2mhI-d63WbNsPijwL1Yw7ydWMO8k\"/><figcaption>（ig@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（ig@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185210746816958464021439.png/rcilwKj2FXEEttkVknyUVMTI_EMdeU9iQD0hmkA9IZo\"/><figcaption>（ig@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><p>8大女神姊妹團氣勢登場　豪派大盒禮物度假放鬆</p><p>譚嘉儀在社交平台興奮寫道：「Big Day😘」及「Bridal Party Love you」，正式公開大婚喜訊。今次婚禮特別選址在峇里島一間頂級豪華度假村舉行，新娘子更貼心地為一眾姊妹準備了一大盒精美禮物。從流出的短片可見，穿上金光閃閃裙褂的譚嘉儀，獲8位姊妹親密環繞；而姊妹團陣容更是相當華麗，包括林鈺洧、陳庭欣、黃嘉雯、鄧伊婷、鄧佩儀、陳丹儀、梁敏巧及王海榛。8位女神齊齊換上統一的湖水藍色單肩長裙，手挽手大踏步步入出門新娘套房準備接新娘儀式，畫面極具氣勢！</p><figure><img alt=\"（ig@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185210988756996096390287.png/B--7FVxeiADh2rsoDGZxNlVSM5o4Hk60TF0bY0xdG2M\"/><figcaption>（ig@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（ig@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185210991126908928369847.png/Igl36R_oNwybKWIOEBstYZ2Tq6fz0xM5wySat8Mkmrc\"/><figcaption>（ig@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（ig@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185210993219997696914287.png/Lr7QO5jc_SciIXdtknGkUfnC-DOWNWLsSDJloUgyZaE\"/><figcaption>（ig@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（ig@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185210995518607360816039.png/KE38rkF7lY_PqawX-zsrhNEqgpJ1WDAXGGd6aBhnemg\"/><figcaption>（ig@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（ig@toby_yanyan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185211561564704768937245.png/aD9j2fGoV-w-ZiYtsJjaklntUQpt_WPD_PmYjPz5mIw\"/><figcaption>（ig@toby_yanyan）</figcaption></figure><p>剛甩拖陳庭欣「進擊」搶鏡　泳池邊大騷火辣身材</p><p>難得遠赴峇里島度假勝地，一班姊妹亦順道在當地放鬆身心。其中回復單身近一年的陳庭欣（Toby）表現得相當「進擊」，在度假村的私人泳池邊穿上藍白間條比堅尼泳衣，大騷豐滿火辣身材，並戴上太陽眼鏡打卡寫下「pool vibe」，吸睛度爆燈！</p><figure><img alt=\"（ig@toby_yanyan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185211338817802240950347.png/yHx42eHblZniLO_SRaNLnB7rfqNK8dlvqIvHw6iLx8M\"/><figcaption>（ig@toby_yanyan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（ig@toby_yanyan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185211497823866880071625.png/tB9WB3hdi71JHcMf_4eq5P_Qq-o1oQKN8NVV3_DVVd8\"/><figcaption>（ig@toby_yanyan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（ig@toby_yanyan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185211500034396160736841.png/6_xSxG_el53vUhUads4tU2-QesLpByVgScGAi0nBgIs\"/><figcaption>（ig@toby_yanyan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（ig@toby_yanyan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185211502219759616926134.png/MOtYV0esTp-qorOr8WULBqa2SLB_M0ew2FM-gthTPoI\"/><figcaption>（ig@toby_yanyan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（ig@toby_yanyan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185211504468037632029831.png/eiHgPhI0kTBnooKMcZ0pf082CnEFjpBS4gj3fuII934\"/><figcaption>（ig@toby_yanyan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（ig@toby_yanyan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185211506632429568419258.png/88V2PNZkpeeZTCI69KgKFjIF7k2NPZaWVJ-gcFSfoHA\"/><figcaption>（ig@toby_yanyan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（ig@carmaneysantiago）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185211672646782976284079.png/4ENmzya9tsCwGRgf5lH7TAiig3xvUcn0Kx2jOysdozs\"/><figcaption>（ig@carmaneysantiago）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（ig@carmaneysantiago）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185211670469808128504719.png/TbRGAUrqz30vvbrTPF6SXKn2IRD5t-J1iecsC4nnLAs\"/><figcaption>（ig@carmaneysantiago）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（ig截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185211807812292608806534.png/ezMeXZ-rPG62x6JEE9n1KW8WWS3_DKRar0zQ9q9M0PY\"/><figcaption>（ig截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（ig截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185211810064764928493872.png/T-uA8rV5ZjcF_CWuXvJUnaK4-rD3t35KxFqaWMRamlg\"/><figcaption>（ig截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（ig截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185211812183019520936840.png/sFSB6QybAFGD4a2xkNX0DOQNj5NhXQVYf1yTGX9ckxk\"/><figcaption>（ig截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（ig截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185211814359994368076258.png/NHjWxnsvOqjKRkDhji5PRx3aEr9C80rSTLORxEyzkcQ\"/><figcaption>（ig截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-09T05:19:01.654416+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":823,"images":20,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}